+- A `beforeSession` throw reaches the caller unchanged, fires `onError` with the thrown `Error`, and then fires `afterSession`; the latter can assume that no user-input hooks, model hooks, tools, or provider interaction ran, and should use the session state only for cleanup appropriate to a turn that was aborted before provider interaction ([validated by: runs error hooks before rethrowing without entering provider interaction](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.beforeSession.test.ts#L28), [validated by: runs onError and afterSession when beforeSession throws](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.beforeSession.acceptance.test.ts#L40)).
 
